x=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Reg}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Reg}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Club}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Club}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subtle}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Subtle}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subtle} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subtle}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall A_\\bullet\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(A_\\bullet,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\alpha\\bigr)\\to\n\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\in C\\;\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\land A_\\alpha=A_\\beta\\cap\\alpha))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subtle} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Subtle}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall A_\\bullet\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(A_\\bullet,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;A_\\alpha\\subseteq\\alpha\\bigr)\\to\n\\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\in C\\;\\exists\\beta\\in C\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\land A_\\alpha=A_\\beta\\cap\\alpha))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Subtle cardinals generalize the concept of &quot;reflection&quot; for sequences of sets.</li>\n<li>Subtle cardinals are weaker than ineffable cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-functi